0. Terms of Condition
You are not allowed to copy and or redistribute this plugin. Also using parts of the code is not permitted. You are not allowed to decompile or analyze the code, except from personal learning
projects.

1. Terms of Depend
You are free to create a plugin with this plugin as a dependency if you publish that plugin for free. However, it is not allowed to include this plugin in the jar file of your plugin.
Creating a plugin that extends parts of this plugin, for instance a tab completer, is also permitted, but again, only if it is published for free.

2. Terms of reviewing the plugin
You are allowed to review this plugin and that will be appreciated. However, do not review the plugin only for reporting one or multiple bugs or other issues.
If you have encountered a bug or another issue, try to send a private message to the owner instead of placing a bad review.
This is not an obligation, but do not be surprised if your review gets ignored if you do not do it on the right way.
